implement defang_ip_addr
========================

-- example -- 
Original: "255.100.50.0"
Defanged: "255[.]100[.]50[.]0"
    
-- dependencies -- 
1. gcc (aarch64)
2. just

-- how to run -- 
$ just run

sample run on apple-silicon:

Original: "1.1.1.1"
Defanged: "1[.]1[.]1[.]1"
---
Original: "255.100.50.0"
Defanged: "255[.]100[.]50[.]0"
---
Original: "192.168.1.1"
Defanged: "192[.]168[.]1[.]1"
---
Original: "10.0.0.1"
Defanged: "10[.]0[.]0[.]1"
---
Original: "no.dots.here"
Defanged: "no[.]dots[.]here"
---
Original: ""
Defanged: ""
---